{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And You</b> — the mem of תורידם belongs to those whose words have multiplied." "<b>they will not halve their days</b> — that the full number of their days will not be completed." "<b>But I trust in You</b> — that You will complete the number of my days, for I am Your servant as You promised me in Your Torah. Or: <b>But I trust in You</b> — that You will bring them down to the pit in half their days."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 55, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:54.364873158Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}